{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"외치기","desc":"<p>문자열을 모두 <b>대문자</b>로 바꾸고 끝에 <code>\"!\"</code>를 붙이는 <code>shout(s)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"shout <- function(s) {\n  paste0(toupper(s), \"!\")\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>toupper()</code> 는 대문자로, <code>paste0()</code> 은 구분 없이 이어 붙여요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"shout(\"hi\")","expected":"HI!","visible":true},{"call":"shout(\"Hello World\")","expected":"HELLO WORLD!","visible":true},{"call":"shout(\"\")","expected":"!","visible":false},{"call":"shout(\"abc1\")","expected":"ABC1!","visible":false}],"starter":"shout <- function(s) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-327"}